.TH tuldif n 0.31.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tclutils::tuldif \- LDIF (RFC 2849) reader/writer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tclutils::tuldif
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parses LDIF into a list of entries (ordered {attr value} pairs) and serializes
back, decoding/encoding base64 values via tclutils::tubase64. See docs/tuldif.md.
.SH KEYWORDS
ldif, ldap, parser
